From fb97086d6da9ba4d124e6ba136504554a529c563 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 19:42:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: buffs only when missing, cast-gated interrupts, solo
 Charge opener, tighter solo pulls (F-219)

- combat: tracks our auras (SMSG_AURA_UPDATE[_ALL]) and enemy casts (SPELL_START/GO/FAILURE);
  ability flags buff (skip while the aura is on us - Battle Shout/seals/blessings were recast
  every fight) and interrupt (only while the target casts); KillRequest.charge_spell opener out
  of combat at 8-25 yd; KillResult.spells lists every cast for the fight log
- runner: Pummel/Rebuke/Arcane Torrent/Kick interrupts; Divine Protection on packs, Lay on Hands;
  Charge offered only for a lone target; isolation judged at 18 yd (aggro reach, Sunstrider's
  Tenders stand 12-15 yd apart); rest to 95 % before every planned pull

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01SQmFdwZBdZ1kNkYTTF4JNJ
